  },
  {
    "id": "05-reason-1",
    "start": 40.2,
    "end": 43.309,
    "text": "These figures describe different risks, not\na causal link.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "05-reason-2",
    "start": 43.309,
    "end": 47.455,
    "text": "SafeNight is designed to turn a request for\nhelp into an acknowledged",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "05-reason-3",
    "start": 47.455,
    "end": 47.8,
    "text": "response.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "06-unsafe-1",
    "start": 48.2,
    "end": 53.8,
    "text": "Back outside, Maya opens SafeNight and\ntaps, I feel unsafe.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "07-incoming-call-1",
    "start": 54.2,
    "end": 57.8,
    "text": "In this proposed flow, SafeNight calls her.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "08-call-check-1",
    "start": 58.2,
    "end": 62.04,
    "text": "Maya, this is SafeNight responding to your\nrequest.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": "SafeNight"
  },
  {
    "id": "08-call-check-2",
    "start": 62.04,
    "end": 64.44,
    "text": "You shared the east entrance.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": "SafeNight"
  },
  {
    "id": "08-call-check-3",
    "start": 64.44,
    "end": 67.8,
    "text": "Is that correct, and are you safe?",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": "SafeNight"
  },
  {
    "id": "09-call-reply-1",
    "start": 68.2,
    "end": 70.96,
    "text": "That’s right. I don’t feel safe.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": "Maya"
  },
  {
    "id": "09-call-reply-2",
    "start": 70.96,
    "end": 72.8,
    "text": "Please contact campus safety.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": "Maya"
  },
  {
    "id": "10-call-confirm-1",
    "start": 73.2,
    "end": 75.883,
    "text": "I’ll send your confirmed location and\nrequest.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": "SafeNight"
  },
  {
    "id": "10-call-confirm-2",
    "start": 75.883,
    "end": 77.8,
    "text": "I’m waiting for their acknowledgment.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": "SafeNight"
  },
  {
    "id": "11-handoff-1",
    "start": 78.2,
    "end": 82.422,
    "text": "The proposed handoff sends the confirmed\ndetails to an authorized",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "11-handoff-2",
    "start": 82.422,
    "end": 85.8,
    "text": "campus-safety channel. This demonstration\nuses a simulated receiver.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "12-app-group-1",
    "start": 86.2,
    "end": 88.617,
    "text": "Now let’s look inside SafeNight.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "12-app-group-2",
    "start": 88.617,
    "end": 91.517,
    "text": "A Night Out connects the group.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "12-app-group-3",
    "start": 91.517,
    "end": 95.867,
    "text": "Each person chooses their sharing\npermissions and approved contacts",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "12-app-group-4",
    "start": 95.867,
    "end": 97.8,
    "text": "before the night begins.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "13-app-incident-1",
    "start": 98.2,
    "end": 102.376,
    "text": "The incident timeline brings requests,\nresponses, plans, and tool",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "13-app-incident-2",
    "start": 102.376,
    "end": 107.016,
    "text": "receipts together. Simulated actions stay\nlabeled, so the demo separates",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "13-app-incident-3",
    "start": 107.016,
    "end": 109.8,
    "text": "the working interface from proposed\nintegrations.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "14-app-response-1",
    "start": 110.2,
    "end": 113.122,
    "text": "An approved friend can acknowledge the\nrequest.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "14-app-response-2",
    "start": 113.122,
    "end": 118.13,
    "text": "The group can see the difference between a\nmessage being sent and",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "14-app-response-3",
    "start": 118.13,
    "end": 119.8,
    "text": "someone agreeing to help.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "15-permissions-1",
    "start": 120.2,
    "end": 123.226,
    "text": "Location sharing stays scoped and visible.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "15-permissions-2",
    "start": 123.226,
    "end": 129.278,
    "text": "The response uses information the person\nchose to share, and keeps stale",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "15-permissions-3",
    "start": 129.278,
    "end": 131.8,
    "text": "updates distinct from confirmed details.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "16-coordination-1",
    "start": 132.2,
    "end": 136.376,
    "text": "Nemotron is intended to interpret context\nand coordinate permitted",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "16-coordination-2",
    "start": 136.376,
    "end": 140.552,
    "text": "tools. SpacetimeDB owns the durable state,\npermissions, and follow-up",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "16-coordination-3",
    "start": 140.552,
    "end": 143.8,
    "text": "logic. Immediate alerts stay independent of\nAI.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "17-human-handoff-1",
    "start": 144.2,
    "end": 147.912,
    "text": "A sent message is not a completed handoff.",
