    "end": 155.8,
    "text": "until a person confirms who is taking\nresponsibility.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "18-resolution-1",
    "start": 156.2,
    "end": 160.662,
    "text": "When Maya can confirm her status, she\nchecks in explicitly.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "18-resolution-2",
    "start": 160.662,
    "end": 165.123,
    "text": "The incident closes through human\nconfirmation, rather than assuming a",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "18-resolution-3",
    "start": 165.123,
    "end": 167.8,
    "text": "location update means everything is okay.",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "19-evidence-1",
    "start": 168.2,
    "end": 174.25,
    "text": "One timeline: the request, the response,\nthe handoff, and the confirmed",
    "type": "speech",
    "speaker": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "19-evidence-2",
    "start": 174.25,
